┃ Select the agent harness to wire                                              
┃ Which LLM harness MoAI wires for this project. 'claude' is the recommended    
┃ default; the --llm flag overrides this answer.                                
┃ ▸ Claude (Recommended) - Wire the Claude side only (.mcp.json provisioning)   
┃   Codex                - Wire the .codex/ hook layer + MCP config; skips .mcp.
┃   json provisioning                                                           
  Select autonomy tier                                                          
  Controls how many turns the session runs without prompting. 'semi-auto' is the
  recommended default.                                                          
  ▸ Semi-auto (Recommended) - Prompt before each non-trivial action             
    Automatic               - Run milestones autonomously; prompt at gates      
    Fully-autonomous        - Requires sandbox proof (Docker/gVisor/etc.)       
                                                                                
                                                                                

